# Subsonic Wind Tunnel

A work-in-progress subsonic wind tunnel designed and built by **Mohamed Chabou** and **Muhammad Zakariyya Hossain**.

The project is based on and adapted from James P. K. Wadhwani's *Subsonic Wind Tunnel* design on Instructables.

## Overview

The goal of this project is to construct a functional small-scale wind tunnel for experimenting with airflow and aerodynamic behavior.

The tunnel is currently approximately **70% complete**.

## Current Progress

- Wind tunnel structure assembled
- Test section under development
- Diffuser and contraction sections constructed
- Airflow components being integrated
- Electronics and sensing planned

## Arduino & Electronics

Future versions of the project will incorporate Arduino-based sensing and data collection.

